### ============================================
### WITHDRAWAL ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Create withdrawal - SUCCESS
POST {{baseUrl}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "investorId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 50000.00
}

### Create withdrawal - FAIL (exceeds balance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "investorId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 999999.00
}

### Create withdrawal - FAIL (exceeds 90%)
POST {{baseUrl}}/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "investorId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "amount": 95000.00
}

### Get withdrawal history
GET {{baseUrl}}/withdrawals/history/1